		"description": "<p>At 3rd level when you choose this archetype, you gain the following two Channel Divinity options.</p>\n<p><em><strong>Second Chance.</strong></em> When a friendly creature (including yourself) is suffering effects as result of a failed saving throw, you can spend your reaction to allow it to attempt that saving throw again.</p>\n<p><em><strong>Choose to Succeed.</strong></em> When a friendly creature (including yourself) fails an ability check, you can spend your reaction to allow it to roll the check again with an expertise die.</p>",
